""
qec_demo.py

Educational quantum error correction demo. 

This single-file project covers four ideas:

1. Surface-code toy simulator
2. QEC syndrome extraction and decoding
3. Stabilizer / Clifford circuit simulator
4. Quantum resource estimator

Important note:
Shows understanding of the architecture of QEC software, not to replace a
production simulator such as Stim, PyMatching, Qiskit Aer, or a hardware control
stack.

Run:
    python qec_demo.py
"""

